# The parent terraform/.gitignore already excludes .terraform/, *.tfstate and
# *.tfvars. That matters more here than anywhere else in this repo: Render
# state contains the generated SESSION_SECRET and the Postgres password.

# ...but DO commit the provider lock file. The exact version pin in
# versions.tf is only half of reproducibility; the lock file records the
# provider checksums. This negates the `.terraform.lock.hcl` rule in
# terraform/.gitignore.
!.terraform.lock.hcl
